{% comment %}
  🌿 Snippet: Clinical Trial Results & Dermatological Testing Showcase
{% endcomment %}

<div class="clinical-results-card my-5 p-4.5 rounded-xl bg-amber-50/60 border border-amber-200/80">
  <div class="clinical-header flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="text-xl">🔬</span>
      <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 uppercase tracking-wide">
        نتائج دراسة سريرية مثبتة (على 50 إمرأة مغربية)
      </h4>
    </div>
    <span class="text-[10px] font-semibold text-emerald-900 bg-emerald-100 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md">
      مختبر جلدياً
    </span>
  </div>

  <div class="clinical-stats-grid grid grid-cols-3 gap-2.5 text-center">
    <div class="clinical-stat-item p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-xs border border-amber-100">
      <span class="block text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-900" dir="ltr">98%</span>
      <span class="block text-[11px] text-stone-600 font-medium leading-snug mt-1">ترطيب عميق يدوم 24 ساعة</span>
    </div>
    <div class="clinical-stat-item p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-xs border border-amber-100">
      <span class="block text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-900" dir="ltr">94%</span>
      <span class="block text-[11px] text-stone-600 font-medium leading-snug mt-1">إشراقة وتوحيد لون البشرة</span>
    </div>
    <div class="clinical-stat-item p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white shadow-xs border border-amber-100">
      <span class="block text-xl font-extrabold text-emerald-900" dir="ltr">91%</span>
      <span class="block text-[11px] text-stone-600 font-medium leading-snug mt-1">انخفاض ملحوظ في الخطوط</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
